From: "R. Daneel Olivaw" <rdaneel@gozala.io>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 01:40:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] feat(query)!: an embedder supplies a formula, asked in a
 premise query and held by no rule

`Extension` and `Extensions` give the engine an embedder's pure formula,
evaluated by the new `PremiseQuery`. A rule holding one is refused at
compile, and a premise naming none the embedder holds when it is built.
---
